{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜已，互跪，燒香，散華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輟唱，想云：我此香華徧十方，至同入無生證佛智。想已，唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜互跪，贊云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚已重燒香，然彼禮諸相好"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不停蚊蚋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七處滿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮已，重燒香，懺悔，發願云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起身一拜，重燒香散華，如法旋繞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩摩訶薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或三徧，或七遍，旋畢至佛前，三自歸依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0618c1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0618c1001", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0618c1301", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0618c1301", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
